<title>USA: Safeguard Health names Cox president.</title>
<headline>Safeguard Health names Cox president.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>SafeGuard Health Enterprises Inc said Monday it had named John Cox as president and a member of the board.</p>
<p>The move expands the board to seven members and gives Cox the president's duties that had been held by Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Steven Baileys.</p>
<p>Baileys remains chairman and CEO.</p>
<p>Cox, 45, has been the company's executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
